UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetScalingFactor
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when pool doesn't exist
    │   └── it should revert with "PNP"
    └── when pool exists
        ├── when fee cap is set to 0
        │   └── it should revert with "ISF"
        └── when fee cap is not 0
            ├── when scaling factor is higher than max scaling factor cap
            │   └── it should revert with "ISF"
            └── when scaling factor is less than max scaling factor cap
                ├── it should set scaling factor
                └── it should emit a {ScalingFactorSet} event
